OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed over #70m tree-planting
OL,4,Ainvestment scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been jailed over a #70m
OL,7,Ftree-planting scam that cost 3,000
OL,8,Finvestors their workplace pensions.
OL,10,FMatthew Pickard, 55, Stephen Greenaway,
OL,11,F46, and Paul Laver, 47, bought luxury
OL,12,Fcars and holidays from the profits of
OL,13,FBournemouth-based Ethical Forestry Ltd,
OL,14,Fwhich promised forestry investments in
OL,15,FCosta Rica.
OL,17,FThe firm took millions of pounds from
OL,18,Fsmall investors before it collapsed in
OL,19,F2015, Southwark Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
